                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "dQobs",
                                  "name": "Section 1 Para",
                                  "fill": "$--foreground",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "本报告依据《药品注册管理办法》及 ICH Q1A(R2) 指导原则，对盐酸二甲双胍片（规格：0.5g）进行稳定性评估。试验包括加速试验（40±2℃ / 75±5% RH，6 个月）和长期试验（25±2℃ / 60±5% RH，36 个月）。",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                  "fontSize": 14,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "mxhsm",
                                  "name": "Section 2 Title",
                                  "fill": "$--foreground",
                                  "content": "2  检测结果",
                                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                  "fontSize": 16,
                                  "fontWeight": "600"
                                },
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "tK6D6",
                                  "name": "Section 2 Para",
                                  "fill": "$--foreground",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "2.1  性状：白色薄膜衣片，除去包衣后显白色。各时间点外观均无明显变化。\n2.2  含量测定（HPLC）：初始含量 99.8%，加速 6 个月后 99.2%，长期 36 个月后 98.5%，均符合质量标准（95.0%–105.0%）。\n2.3  有关物质：最大单个杂质 ≤0.10%，总杂质 ≤0.30%，符合限度要求。",
                                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                                  "fontSize": 14,
                                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                                },
